# Hallow's Eve pack - client-namespace additions, en-US. This file's basename ("client") targets the
# game's own client namespace, so each key loads as client.<key>: here the item-tooltip label of a
# stat this pack ships, itemTooltip.stats.<StatId>. {value} is the client's own placeholder, filled
# with the item's amount. These keys only add; none replaces a key the client ships.
itemTooltip.stats.Reputation_Hallows_Eve_Old_Jack = Old Jack's Favor: {value}
itemTooltip.stats.Reputation_Hallows_Eve_Hallowed = Lantern Watch Favor: {value}
